#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to use stretch to defer timing resolution with dynamic circuits"
msgstr ""
"Cara menggunakan stretch untuk menangguhkan resolusi pemasaan dengan litar "
"dinamik"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deferred timing resolution using stretch"
msgstr "Resolusi pemasaan tertangguh menggunakan stretch"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deferred timing resolution using stretch {#deferred-timing-resolution-using-"
"stretch}"
msgstr ""
"Resolusi pemasaan tertangguh menggunakan stretch {#deferred-timing-"
"resolution-using-stretch}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The OpenQASM 3 language specification contains a `stretch` type with which "
"you can specify relative timing of operations instead of absolute timing. "
"Support for `stretch` as durations for "
"[`Delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay)"
" instructions was added in [Qiskit "
"v2.0.0](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes/2.0#200). The "
"concrete value of a stretch duration is resolved at compile time, after the "
"exact duration of calibrated gates are known.  The compiler tries to "
"minimize the stretch duration, subject to timing constraints on one or more "
"qubits. You can then express gate designs such as evenly spacing gates (for "
"example, to implement a higher-order echo decoupling sequence), left-"
"aligning a sequence of gates, or applying a gate for the duration of some "
"sub-circuit, without knowing the exact timing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Spesifikasi bahasa OpenQASM 3 mengandungi jenis `stretch` yang membolehkan "
"anda menentukan pemasaan relatif operasi berbanding pemasaan mutlak. "
"Sokongan untuk `stretch` sebagai tempoh untuk arahan "
"[`Delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay)"
" telah ditambah dalam [Qiskit "
"v2.0.0](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/release-notes/2.0#200). "
"Nilai konkrit tempoh stretch diselesaikan pada masa kompilasi, selepas "
"tempoh tepat get yang ditentukur diketahui. Pengkompil cuba meminimumkan "
"tempoh stretch, tertakluk pada kekangan pemasaan pada satu atau lebih qubit."
" Anda kemudiannya boleh menyatakan reka bentuk get seperti meruangkan get "
"secara sama rata (contohnya, untuk melaksanakan urutan penyahgandingan echo "
"berperingkat tinggi), menjajarkan kiri urutan get, atau menggunakan get "
"untuk tempoh sub-litar tertentu, tanpa mengetahui pemasaan tepat.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Examples {#examples}"
msgstr "Contoh {#examples}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamical decoupling {#dynamical-decoupling}"
msgstr "Penyahgandingan dinamik {#dynamical-decoupling}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A common use case of `stretch` is to apply dynamical decoupling to an idling"
" qubit while another qubit is undergoing conditional operations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu kes penggunaan biasa `stretch` adalah untuk menggunakan penyahgandingan"
" dinamik pada qubit yang melahu sementara qubit lain sedang menjalani "
"operasi bersyarat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For example, we can use `stretch` to apply an XX dynamical decoupling "
"sequence to qubit 1, for the duration of the conditional block applied to "
"qubit 0, as illustrated by the following diagram:\n"
msgstr ""
"Contohnya, kita boleh menggunakan `stretch` untuk menggunakan urutan "
"penyahgandingan dinamik XX pada qubit 1, untuk tempoh blok bersyarat yang "
"digunakan pada qubit 0, seperti yang diilustrasikan dalam gambar rajah "
"berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Image illustrating the following "
"circuit](/docs/images/guides/stretch/stretch.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Image illustrating the following "
"circuit](/docs/images/guides/stretch/stretch.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The corresponding circuit would look like the following. Note that a pair of"
" barriers is needed to define the boundaries of this relative timing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Litar yang bersesuaian akan kelihatan seperti berikut. Perhatikan bahawa "
"sepasang halangan diperlukan untuk menentukan sempadan pemasaan relatif "
"ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Scheduling alignment {#scheduling-alignment}"
msgstr "Penjajaran penjadualan {#scheduling-alignment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example uses `stretch` to ensure a sequence of gates between two "
"barriers are left-aligned, whatever their actual durations are:\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini menggunakan `stretch` untuk memastikan urutan get antara dua "
"halangan disejajarkan kiri, apapun tempoh sebenar mereka:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" When using `stretch` with Qiskit Runtime, any remainder resulting from a "
"stretch resolution is added to the first delay that uses the stretch.\n"
msgstr ""
" Apabila menggunakan `stretch` dengan Qiskit Runtime, sebarang baki yang "
"terhasil daripada resolusi stretch ditambahkan kepada kelewatan pertama yang"
" menggunakan stretch itu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Contoh:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"    circuit.delay(100, q0)\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 26\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"     ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"    circuit.delay(100, q0)\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 26\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.delay(a, q1)  # resolve to 25\n"
"    circuit.x(q1)  # duration: 8\n"
"    circuit.barrier(q0, q1)\n"
"     ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The above code resolves to a value of 25 with a remainder of 1. The first "
"delay`[a]` will have the remainder added.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod di atas diselesaikan kepada nilai 25 dengan baki 1. Kelewatan pertama "
"`[a]` akan ditambah bakinya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Stretch resolution equation:  $a + 8 + a + 8 + a + 8 = 100   =   3*a + 24$\n"
msgstr ""
"Persamaan resolusi stretch:  $a + 8 + a + 8 + a + 8 = 100   =   3*a + 24$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View stretch values in Qiskit Runtime {#view-stretch-values-in-qiskit-"
"runtime}"
msgstr ""
"Lihat nilai stretch dalam Qiskit Runtime {#view-stretch-values-in-qiskit-"
"runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The actual value of a stretch duration is resolved at compile time, after "
"the circuit is scheduled. When running a Sampler job in Qiskit Runtime, you "
"can view the resolved stretch values in the job result metadata.  Support "
"for `stretch` in Qiskit Runtime is currently experimental, so you need to "
"first set an experimental option to enable its retrieval, then access the "
"data directly from the metadata as follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nilai sebenar tempoh stretch diselesaikan pada masa kompilasi, selepas litar"
" dijadualkan. Apabila menjalankan kerja Sampler dalam Qiskit Runtime, anda "
"boleh melihat nilai stretch yang diselesaikan dalam metadata keputusan "
"kerja. Sokongan untuk `stretch` dalam Qiskit Runtime masih eksperimental, "
"jadi anda perlu menetapkan opsyen eksperimental dahulu untuk mendayakan "
"pengambilannya, kemudian akses data terus daripada metadata seperti "
"berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Although the total circuit time is returned in the \"compilation\" metadata, this is NOT the time used for billing (QPU time).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Walaupun jumlah masa litar dikembalikan dalam metadata \"compilation\", ini BUKAN masa yang digunakan untuk pengebilan (masa QPU).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Understand the metadata output {#understand-the-metadata-output}"
msgstr "Fahami output metadata {#understand-the-metadata-output}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The `stretch_values` metadata returns the following information:\n"
msgstr "Metadata `stretch_values` mengembalikan maklumat berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Name:** The name of the applied stretch.\n"
msgstr "**Nama:** Nama stretch yang digunakan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Value:** The requested goal value.\n"
msgstr "**Nilai:** Nilai matlamat yang diminta.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Remainder:** The remainder from resolving the stretch, which is added to "
"the first delay that uses the stretch.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Baki:** Baki daripada menyelesaikan stretch, yang ditambahkan kepada "
"kelewatan pertama yang menggunakan stretch itu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Expanded values:** Sets of values that specify the stretch start and its "
"duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nilai yang dikembangkan:** Set nilai yang menentukan permulaan stretch dan"
" tempohnya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Example {#example}"
msgstr "Contoh {#example}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Metadata output {#metadata-output}"
msgstr "Output metadata {#metadata-output}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The values returned for duration depend on the goal value and the calculated"
" remainder.  For example, these are the durations returned for foo:\n"
msgstr ""
"Nilai yang dikembalikan untuk tempoh bergantung pada nilai matlamat dan baki"
" yang dikira. Contohnya, ini adalah tempoh yang dikembalikan untuk foo:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`foo value` + `remainder` (8+2 = 10) \n"
msgstr "`nilai foo` + `baki` (8+2 = 10)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`foo value` * 3 (8 x 3 = 24)\n"
msgstr "`nilai foo` * 3 (8 x 3 = 24)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`foo value` * 2 (8 x 2 = 16)\n"
msgstr "`nilai foo` * 2 (8 x 2 = 16)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "You can use a visualization to help understand and verify the timing. \n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menggunakan visualisasi untuk membantu memahami dan mengesahkan "
"pemasaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In the following image, based on the example output, `foo` corresponds to "
"the stretches on Qubit 2. The first stretch delay that uses `foo` starts at "
"the end of the `init_play` (1365). The stretch duration is 10, so that delay"
" ends when the `x` gate starts (1365+10=1375). You can interpret the second "
"and third stretches similarly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam imej berikut, berdasarkan output contoh, `foo` bersesuaian dengan "
"stretch pada qubit 2. Kelewatan stretch pertama yang menggunakan `foo` "
"bermula di penghujung `init_play` (1365). Tempoh stretch ialah 10, jadi "
"kelewatan itu berakhir apabila get `x` bermula (1365+10=1375). Anda boleh "
"mentafsir stretch kedua dan ketiga dengan cara yang sama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![The output from the `draw_circuit_schedule_timing` command is "
"shown.](/docs/images/guides/stretch/stretch-visualization.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![The output from the `draw_circuit_schedule_timing` command is "
"shown.](/docs/images/guides/stretch/stretch-visualization.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the sliders at the bottom, the controls at the top (hover over your "
"output image to reveal these), and the legend on the side of the output to "
"customize the view. Hover over the image to view exact data.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan gelangsar di bahagian bawah, kawalan di bahagian atas (tuding ke "
"atas imej output anda untuk mendedahkannya), dan legenda di sisi output "
"untuk menyesuaikan paparan. Tuding ke atas imej untuk melihat data tepat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For full details, see the [Visualize circuit timing](/guides/qiskit-runtime-"
"circuit-timing) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk butiran penuh, lihat topik [Visualisasi pemasaan "
"litar](/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Runtime limitations {#qiskit-runtime-limitations}"
msgstr "Had Qiskit Runtime {#qiskit-runtime-limitations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Support for `stretch` in Qiskit Runtime is currently experimental and has "
"the following constraints:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sokongan untuk `stretch` dalam Qiskit Runtime masih eksperimental dan "
"mempunyai kekangan berikut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- At most one stretch variable per _qubit set_ between barriers (implicit and explicit). A qubit set is one or more qubits; these sets must be mutually exclusive.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Paling banyak satu pemboleh ubah stretch per _set qubit_ antara halangan (tersirat dan eksplisit). Set qubit ialah satu atau lebih qubit; set-set ini mesti saling eksklusif.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Tidak sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q0)  # Invalid because 2 stretches are applied on q0\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q0)  # Invalid because 2 stretches are applied on q0\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q2)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, (q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(b, q2)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- The area surrounded by a set of barriers is called a _barrier region_. A stretch variable cannot be used in multiple barrier regions.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Kawasan yang dikelilingi oleh set halangan dipanggil _kawasan halangan_. Pemboleh ubah stretch tidak boleh digunakan dalam beberapa kawasan halangan.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Tidak sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used in two barrier regions\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"         ```\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used in two barrier regions\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"         ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ![Illustration of the previous code "
"output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/bad-barrier-region.svg 'Invalid use of "
"stretch in barrier regions')\n"
msgstr ""
"        ![Illustration of the previous code "
"output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/bad-barrier-region.svg 'Invalid use of "
"stretch in barrier regions')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used inside a barrier region that is on q0 and q1\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier(q2)\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        ```\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        # Stretch a is used inside a barrier region that is on q0 and q1\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier(q2)\n"
"        circuit.delay(a, q0)\n"
"        circuit.barrier((q0, q1))\n"
"        ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ![Illustration of the previous code "
"output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/good-barrier-region.svg 'Valid use of "
"stretch in a barrier region')\n"
msgstr ""
"        ![Illustration of the previous code "
"output](/docs/images/guides/stretch/good-barrier-region.svg 'Valid use of "
"stretch in a barrier region')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions are limited to those of the form `X*stretch + Y` where `X` and `Y` are floating point or integer constants.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Ungkapan stretch terhad kepada bentuk `X*stretch + Y` di mana `X` dan `Y` adalah pemalar titik apung atau integer.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Tidak sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        c = circuit.add_stretch(\"c\")\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        c = circuit.add_stretch(\"c\")\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        # (a /  b) * c is not supported\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.mul(expr.div(a, b), c), q1)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        # (a /  b) * c is not supported\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.mul(expr.div(a, b), c), q1)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"     <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        from qiskit.circuit import Duration\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        from qiskit.circuit import Duration\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(expr.mul(a, 2), Duration.dt(3)), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(expr.mul(a, 2), Duration.dt(3)), 0)\n"
"        ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"    </Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- Stretch expressions can only include a single stretch variable.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"        <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Invalid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"- Ungkapan stretch hanya boleh mengandungi satu pemboleh ubah stretch.\n"
"    <Tabs>\n"
"        <TabItem value=\"Invalid\" label=\"Tidak sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, b), 0)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Valid\">\n"
msgstr ""
"        ```python\n"
"        a = circuit.add_stretch(\"a\")\n"
"        b = circuit.add_stretch(\"b\")\n"
"        circuit.delay(expr.add(a, b), 0)\n"
"         ```\n"
"     </TabItem>\n"
"         <TabItem value=\"Valid\" label=\"Sah\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
